# =============================================================================
# File: .gitignore
# Version: 3
# Path: .gitignore
# Description: Monorepo-wide gitignore. Uses ** patterns to cover current
#              and future sub-projects (ay_platform_core, ay_platform_ui).
#
#              v3 (2026-09-15): dropped `**/ay_extractor/**`. That pattern
#              sat in the "Secrets" block beside *.pem / *.key, but
#              ay_extractor is `ayextractor` 0.4.0, licensed Proprietary
#              exactly like ay_platform_core — nothing secret about it.
#              Its cost was concrete: C13 is a DEPLOYED component whose
#              image `ghcr.io/…/aywizz-c13-extractor` is listed as published
#              in VERSIONING.md §10, yet CI could never build it — the
#              Dockerfile's `COPY ay_extractor/src` found nothing in a clean
#              checkout, so the AKS pull failed against an image that had
#              never been pushed. The platform could not be rebuilt from its
#              own repository. Tracking the source fixes that at the root.
#              `**/output/` below replaces the incidental coverage this
#              pattern used to give ay_extractor/output.
# =============================================================================

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/
.Python
sample-code-main

# Virtual environments
.venv/
venv/
env/

# Testing caches (anywhere in the monorepo)
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
.coverage.*
htmlcov/

# Test reports (generated, never committed). Pattern covers any sub-project.
**/reports/*
!**/reports/.gitkeep

# Generated run output / local caches (root `output/`, ay_extractor/output).
**/output/

# Node.js (anticipating ay_platform_ui)
node_modules/
.next/
.turbo/
dist/
*.tsbuildinfo

# IDE
.vscode/*
!.vscode/settings.json
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea/

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Secrets
.env
.env.local
.env.secret
# Operator-authored k8s overlay config (non-secret, but environment-specific)
.env.config
*.pem
*.key
**/research/**
